=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(22年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"82.7\" width=\"320\" height=\"14.5\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,84.2 9.1,79.0 14.2,75.9 19.3,78.5 24.5,81.3 29.6,71.3 34.7,67.8 39.8,72.6 44.9,61.1 50.0,52.4 55.1,22.3 60.3,13.8 65.4,34.3 70.5,36.7 75.6,36.5 80.7,14.3 85.8,17.5 91.0,16.5 96.1,13.4 101.2,12.8 106.3,17.3 111.4,15.4 116.5,21.9 121.6,20.8 126.8,27.6 131.9,27.8 137.0,27.8 142.1,28.9 147.2,28.4 152.3,31.0 157.4,38.0 162.6,50.4 167.7,52.2 172.8,52.4 177.9,45.0 183.0,50.6 188.1,48.3 193.2,50.0 198.4,49.6 203.5,45.6 208.6,43.5 213.7,42.6 218.8,42.2 223.9,46.5 229.0,39.5 234.2,46.7 239.3,48.7 244.4,45.4 249.5,38.7 254.6,51.5 259.7,55.2 264.9,51.3 270.0,51.3 275.1,46.7 280.2,50.6 285.3,55.2 290.4,53.3 295.5,50.4 300.7,51.3 305.8,55.0 310.9,54.6 316.0,56.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 96.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 96.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 96.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 96.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 96.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 96.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 96.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 96.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62